  m_Name: Lito_W25_Teach
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueNode
  speakerName: Lito
  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: dec1559c1c146ff4c8cb2f55c759d194, type: 3}
  dialogueText: 'Agannadka! Adda kalesa nga lumabas!


    No kasapulam a dumteng
    ti maysa a tao iti bassit a panaguray ken aguray kenka, mabalinmo nga ibaga ti
    ''urayennak.''


    Kayatna a saoen ti ''please wait'' wenno ''wait for me.''


    Denggem
    a naimbag: urayennak.


    Ita, padasem nga ibagam ti ''urayennak'' iti bukodmo
    a timek.'
  translatedText: 'Look out! A horse carriage is passing through!

    When you need
    someone to pause and wait for you, you can say ''urayennak.''

    It means ''please
    wait'' or ''wait for me.''

    Now, try saying ''urayennak'' yourself.'
